OL,3,AEighteen Kent beaches closed due to oil
OL,4,Aon coastline
OL,5,
OL,6,FEighteen beaches in Kent have been
OL,7,Fclosed after "significant deposits of
OL,8,Foil" were found along the coastline.
OL,10,FPopular tourist beaches at Margate and
OL,11,FRamsgate are among the areas affected
OL,12,Fby the spill.
OL,14,FThanet District Council (TDC) reported
OL,15,Fthe incident on Wednesday evening. The
OL,16,Fsource of the oil has not been
OL,17,Fidentified.
OL,19,FThe local authority said the decision
OL,20,Fto close access to beaches "had not
OL,21,Fbeen taken lightly".
